---
// The lane line's static track (04 section 5): a dashed vertical line in the
// left gutter, desktop only. The scroll-linked --lane fill arrives with the
// scene in Stage 4; this track is also its reduced-motion and no-JS state.
---

<aside class="lane-line" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg width="2" height="100%">
    <line x1="1" y1="0" x2="1" y2="100%"></line>
  </svg>
</aside>
